</div></nav>

<div class="w chead">
  <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &#8250; {H1}</div>
  <h1>{H1}</h1>
  <p class="intro">{INTRO}</p>
  <div class="cta">
    <a class="btn b1" href="/app">Book a free visit</a>
    <a class="btn b2" href="/app">Instant estimate</a>
  </div>
  <div class="chips">
    <span class="chip"><b>{COUNT}</b> designs made</span>
    <span class="chip">2 year warranty</span>
    <span class="chip">100% virgin PVC</span>
    <span class="chip">Nikol, Ahmedabad</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="w" style="padding-top:26px">
  <div class="ggrid">{GRID}</div>
  <div style="margin-top:18px">{ALBUMBTN}</div>
</section>

<section class="w">
  <div class="eyebrow">What a job includes</div>
  <h2>Made to the room, not to a catalogue</h2>
  <ul class="incl">{INCL}</ul>
</section>

<div class="why"><div class="w">
  <div class="eyebrow">The material</div>
  <h2>Why PVC here</h2>
  <div class="wgrid">
    <div class="wi"><h3>100% Waterproof</h3><p>It does not swell, warp or delaminate. No wood inside means water has nothing to spoil.</p></div>
    <div class="wi"><h3>Termite and borer proof</h3><p>There is no organic material in it, so there is nothing for termites or borers to eat. For life.</p></div>
    <div class="wi"><h3>Fitted in about 10 days</h3><p>A full home, start to handover. Made in the workshop, fitted at your place.</p></div>
    <div class="wi"><h3>2 year warranty</h3><p>Free service visits for fitting and adjustment, on a written certificate.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<section class="w">
  <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
  <h2>Four steps, no surprises</h2>
  <div class="steps" style="margin-top:22px">
    <div class="step"><em>1</em><div><h3>Free site visit</h3><p>We come to your home and measure properly. No charge, no obligation.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><em>2</em><div><h3>Written estimate</h3><p>An itemised PDF - room by room, rate by rate. Nothing added later.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><em>3</em><div><h3>We build and fit</h3><p>Progress photos land in your app as the work goes on.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><em>4</em><div><h3>Handover and warranty</h3><p>A warranty certificate, and free service visits for two years.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="w">
  <div class="eyebrow">Customers</div>
  <h2>What they said</h2>
  <div class="revs">{REVS}</div>
</section>

<section class="w">
  <div class="big">
    <h2>Let us measure your home</h2>
    <p>Tell us which rooms you have in mind. We visit, measure, and send the estimate as a PDF.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn b1" href="/app">Book a free visit</a>
      <a class="btn bw" href="{WA}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">Also made by us</div><h2>Other rooms</h2></div>
  <div class="others" style="margin-top:18px">{OTHERS}</div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="w">
